  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "U.S. President Donald Trump arrived in Shenzhen, China, on Wednesday to attend the annual Asia-Pacific Economic Cooperation (APEC) summit. Upon his arrival, he was personally greeted by Chinese President Xi Jinping, a gesture seen as reciprocal for the reception Trump previously extended to the Chinese leader in the United States. Following his arrival, President Trump joined President Xi and Russian President Vladimir Putin ahead of scheduled three-way talks. This trilateral meeting, which is expected to occur on Thursday, marks an unprecedented diplomatic gathering between the three heads of state. According to reports, the leaders intend to use these discussions to address significant international issues, specifically focusing on the ongoing wars in Ukraine and Iran, alongside broader concerns regarding nuclear disarmament and global stability. This summit represents one of the most anticipated diplomatic events in recent years.",
